The Amazon, considered the lung of the world, is a territory shared by these nations.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:41.766
and is increasingly threatened by intensive activities such as agriculture, livestock, and mining, considerably increasing the concentrations of carbon dioxide,

00:03:41.766 --> 00:03:45.150
