00:03:47.186 --> 00:03:53.449
Central American countries such as Mexico and Nicaragua are highly vulnerable to climate change.

00:03:53.449 --> 00:03:58.431
Mexico, a megadiverse country, faces various challenges.

00:03:58.431 --> 00:04:09.475
It has the tensions of areas of deforested forests, as well as marine ecosystems deteriorated by the increase in temperature and the acidification of its water mass, and

00:04:09.475 --> 00:04:16.118
the catastrophic impacts due to increasingly intense and frequent storms and hurricanes.

00:04:16.142 --> 00:04:25.162
Heat waves and cold periods in some regions have accelerated the desertification of large areas of land.

00:04:25.162 --> 00:04:31.242
