00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:43.238
more resilient and ready for transformation and change processes.

00:09:44.718 --> 00:09:47.058
Our commitment is now.

00:09:47.058 --> 00:09:58.918
We must act to mitigate and adapt to climate change with actions that lead to diversifying food production, protecting natural resources, ensuring

00:09:58.918 --> 00:10:11.058
